@title A toast fades in quietly and is fully readable once settled
@area Layout
# Polish: toasts ease in over 160 ms and out over 300 ms, opacity only. Reduce motion shows them at full opacity at once (unit tests in app/motion.rs).
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text export pdf
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot toast-settled
check_layout
